          "limit": 1.15,
          "unit": "x",
          "direction": "min",
          "maintenance": true,
          "text": "The Parent shall not permit the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio as of the last day of any fiscal quarter to be less than (a) 1.15 to 1.00 at any time prior to the fiscal quarter ending March 31, 2027, (b) 1.25 to 1.00 as of the fiscal quarter ending March 31, 2027 until the fiscal quarter ending March 31, 2028, and (c) 1.50 to 1.00 as of the fiscal quarter ending March 31, 2028 and thereafter."
