          "text": "Agreement, elect a step- up of the maximum Leverage Ratio to 0.65 to 1.00 for any fiscal quarter in which a Material Acquisition is consummated following the consummation of a Qualified IPO and for the three (3) consecutive fiscal quarters immediately thereafter; provided, further, that the maximum Leverage Ratio shall not exceed 0.60 to 1.00 for more than four (4) consecutive fiscal quarters in any six (6) consecuti"
