          "type": "liquidity",
          "limit": 75000000.0,
          "unit": "usd",
          "direction": "min",
          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "Restricted Payments in an aggregate amount not to exceed seventy-five percent (75.00%) of Adjusted Funds from Operations if, as of the date of such Restricted Payment made pursuant to this clause (3) and after giving pro forma effect thereto, the Leverage Ratio would be less than 0.525 to 1.00 and Liquidity would be at least $75,000,000;"
